w  whether members of different races will  ever be able to truly understand each  other I feel like the whole concept of  the seven deadly sins story was that the  seven sins even though they're from  different races have been working  together and being good friends this  entire time there are also multiple  examples of members of different races  falling in love with each other  so even bringing up the idea that  different races may not be able to truly  understand each other this late in the  story just doesn't make sense to me feel  free to hit me up with your take down in  the comments below a big shout out to my  visual editor Dakota broski for being so  reliable and helping us get these videos  out to you guys at the rate that we have  been doing please show the man some love  and check out his youtube channel his  weeb credentials are top tier and he is  one of the amazing people who make what  we do possible if you enjoyed this video  you want to see more seventh at least  sense content right here on the channel  please leave a like to let me know and  if you happen to be new to anime uproar  don't forget to subscribe and hit that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications you can also hit me up on  Twitter and Instagram at anime uproar  for all the latest channel and seven  deadly sins news and info I want to give  a big thank you to all of our anime  uproar patrons who support our work and  make videos like this one possible with  all the problems facing YouTube right  now patrons are more important than ever  and we really appreciate it  special thank you to our pro hero tier  patrons including the one and only  Gilgamesh nothing but a fan Jason Wilson  Kings ell drous fanny dolla beat Anatole  Cassatt's kee alpha do on Hale Cruz and  team Sparky 65 and I can't forget the  ones who rise above all other clans a  massive thank you to our the 1 and tier  patrons including Ingrid ah  Ilona out of mana Mac makoto-kun the  world stealers and the school 